{"slug":"/students/subjects/chemistry/environmental-green/air-pollution/","source":"students/subjects/chemistry/environmental-green/air-pollution.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Air Pollution & Control - Chemistry","description":"","subject":"chemistry","body":"<!-- Header -->\n    <nav class=\"bg-white shadow-sm fixed top-0 w-full z-50\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between h-16 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                    <a href=\"/students/subjects/chemistry/environmental-green/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-800 mr-4\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n                    </a>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">Air Pollution &amp; Control</h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hidden sm:block\">\n                        Progress: <span id=\"progressPercent\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-24 sm:w-32 h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full\">\n                        <div id=\"progressBar\" class=\"h-2 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"pt-20 pb-8 px-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n        <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n        <div class=\"bg-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6 animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n            <ul class=\"text-emerald-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                <li>• Identify major air pollutants and their sources</li>\n                <li>• Explain the causes and effects of acid rain</li>\n                <li>• Describe the greenhouse effect and global warming</li>\n                <li>• Explain photochemical smog formation</li>\n                <li>• Describe methods for controlling air pollution</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Introduction -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">1</span>\n                What is Air Pollution?\n            </h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\"><strong>Air pollution</strong> is the introduction of harmful substances into the atmosphere, causing damage to living organisms and the environment.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-red-500 mb-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -exclamation-triangle mr-2\" data-mi=\"warning_amber\">warning_amber</span>Why is Air Pollution a Problem?</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                    <li>• Causes respiratory diseases in humans and animals</li>\n                    <li>• Damages crops and reduces agricultural yields</li>\n                    <li>• Contributes to climate change and global warming</li>\n                    <li>• Causes acid rain that damages buildings and ecosystems</li>\n                    <li>• Depletes the ozone layer</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -industry mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Primary Pollutants</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Released directly from sources:</p>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Carbon monoxide (CO)</li>\n                        <li>• Nitrogen oxides (NOₓ)</li>\n                        <li>• Sulfur dioxide (SO₂)</li>\n                        <li>• Particulate matter (PM)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-purple-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -flask mr-2\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Secondary Pollutants</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Formed by chemical reactions:</p>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Ozone (O₃) at ground level</li>\n                        <li>• Acid rain (H₂SO₄, HNO₃)</li>\n                        <li>• Photochemical smog</li>\n                        <li>• Secondary particulates</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Major Air Pollutants -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">2</span>\n                Major Air Pollutants\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-emerald-50\">\n                            <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 text-left\">Pollutant</th>\n                            <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 text-left\">Formula</th>\n                            <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 text-left\">Sources</th>\n                            <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 text-left\">Effects</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Carbon Monoxide</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">CO</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Vehicle exhaust, incomplete combustion</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Reduces oxygen transport in blood; fatal at high levels</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Sulfur Dioxide</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">SO₂</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Burning fossil fuels, volcanic eruptions</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Acid rain, respiratory problems</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Nitrogen Oxides</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">NOₓ</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Vehicle engines, power plants</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Smog, acid rain, ozone formation</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Particulate Matter</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">PM</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Dust, smoke, construction, vehicles</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Lung diseases, reduced visibility</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Volatile Organic Compounds</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">VOCs</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Paints, solvents, fuel evaporation</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Smog formation, health effects</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Ground-level Ozone</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">O₃</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">NOₓ + VOCs in sunlight</td>\n                            <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Respiratory irritation, crop damage</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: Acid Rain -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">3</span>\n                Acid Rain\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-500 mb-4\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-800 font-medium\"><strong>Acid rain</strong> is rain with a pH below 5.6, caused by sulfur and nitrogen oxides reacting with water in the atmosphere.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-orange-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -cloud-rain mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Formation</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2\"><strong>From Sulfur Dioxide:</strong></p>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm font-mono mb-2\">\n                        SO₂ + H₂O → H₂SO₃<br>\n                        2H₂SO₃ + O₂ → 2H₂SO₄\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2\"><strong>From Nitrogen Oxides:</strong></p>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm font-mono\">\n                        2NO₂ + H₂O → HNO₂ + HNO₃<br>\n                        2NO₂ + H₂O + ½O₂ → 2HNO₃\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -skull-crossbones mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Effects</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                        <li><strong>Lakes &amp; Rivers:</strong> Lowers pH, kills fish and aquatic life</li>\n                        <li><strong>Forests:</strong> Damages leaves, leaches nutrients from soil</li>\n                        <li><strong>Buildings:</strong> Erodes limestone and marble structures</li>\n                        <li><strong>Human Health:</strong> Respiratory problems</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -building mr-2\" data-mi=\"business\">business</span>Effect on Buildings</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2\">Acid rain reacts with calcium carbonate in limestone and marble:</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm font-mono\">\n                    CaCO₃ + H₂SO₄ → CaSO₄ + H₂O + CO₂\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2\">This causes statues and buildings to erode and crumble over time.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: Greenhouse Effect -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">4</span>\n                Greenhouse Effect &amp; Global Warming\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-teal-500 mb-4\">\n                <p class=\"text-teal-800 font-medium\">The <strong>greenhouse effect</strong> is a natural process where certain gases trap heat in the atmosphere. Human activities have enhanced this effect, causing global warming.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2 text-center\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Natural Greenhouse Effect</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Essential for life on Earth</li>\n                        <li>• Keeps Earth ~33°C warmer</li>\n                        <li>• Without it, Earth would be frozen</li>\n                        <li>• Caused by water vapor, CO₂, CH₄ naturally</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2 text-center\"><span class=\"mi -times-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"cancel\">cancel</span>Enhanced Greenhouse Effect</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Caused by human activities</li>\n                        <li>• Rising global temperatures</li>\n                        <li>• Melting ice caps, rising sea levels</li>\n                        <li>• Extreme weather events</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -smog mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Main Greenhouse Gases</h4>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">CO₂</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Burning fossil fuels, deforestation</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">CH₄</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Livestock, rice paddies, landfills</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">N₂O</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Fertilizers, industrial processes</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">CFCs</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Refrigerants, aerosols</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 5: Photochemical Smog -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">5</span>\n                Photochemical Smog\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-amber-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-amber-500 mb-4\">\n                <p class=\"text-amber-800 font-medium\"><strong>Photochemical smog</strong> is a type of air pollution formed when sunlight reacts with nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds (VOCs) in the atmosphere.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-purple-200 mb-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -sun mr-2\" data-mi=\"wb_sunny\">wb_sunny</span>Formation Process</h4>\n                <ol class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><span class=\"bg-purple-200 text-purple-800 w-5 h-5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 font-bold\">1</span>NO₂ (from vehicles) absorbs UV light → NO + O·</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"bg-purple-200 text-purple-800 w-5 h-5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 font-bold\">2</span>O· + O₂ → O₃ (ozone)</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"bg-purple-200 text-purple-800 w-5 h-5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 font-bold\">3</span>VOCs + NOₓ + sunlight → Peroxyacyl nitrates (PANs)</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"bg-purple-200 text-purple-800 w-5 h-5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 font-bold\">4</span>Mixture of O₃, PANs, NOₓ forms brown haze (smog)</li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\">Health Effects</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Eye and throat irritation</li>\n                        <li>• Respiratory problems</li>\n                        <li>• Aggravates asthma</li>\n                        <li>• Reduced lung function</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2\">Conditions for Formation</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• High traffic density</li>\n                        <li>• Strong sunlight (UV radiation)</li>\n                        <li>• Temperature inversion</li>\n                        <li>• Low wind speed</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 6: Control Methods -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">6</span>\n                Air Pollution Control Methods\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -car mr-2\" data-mi=\"directions_car\">directions_car</span>Vehicle Emissions</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• <strong>Catalytic converters:</strong> Convert CO, NOₓ to CO₂, N₂</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Lean-burn engines:</strong> More efficient combustion</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Electric vehicles:</strong> Zero tailpipe emissions</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Improved fuel quality:</strong> Low-sulfur fuels</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -industry mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Industrial Controls</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• <strong>Scrubbers:</strong> Remove SO₂ using lime slurry</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Electrostatic precipitators:</strong> Remove particulates</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Fabric filters:</strong> Capture fine particles</li>\n                        <li>• <strong>Flue gas desulfurization:</strong> Remove sulfur compounds</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-purple-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -leaf mr-2\" data-mi=\"eco\">eco</span>Alternative Energy</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Solar and wind power</li>\n                        <li>• Hydroelectric power</li>\n                        <li>• Nuclear energy</li>\n                        <li>• Biofuels from sustainable sources</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-orange-700 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -gavel mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Regulations</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-1\">\n                        <li>• Emission standards for vehicles</li>\n                        <li>• Industrial emission limits</li>\n                        <li>• Air quality monitoring</li>\n                        <li>• Carbon taxes and trading schemes</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 7: Video -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">7</span>\n                Video: Air Pollution Explained\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                <div class=\"video-container\">\n                    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e6rglsLy1Ys\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 8: Practice Problems -->\n        <div class=\"section-card animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt text-emerald-600 mr-3\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n                Practice Questions\n            </h2>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n                    <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Write equations to show how sulfur dioxide forms acid rain.</p>\n                    <details class=\"mt-2\">\n                        <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Answer</summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            <strong>Step 1:</strong> SO₂ dissolves in water<br>\n                            SO₂ + H₂O → H₂SO₃ (sulfurous acid)<br><br>\n                            <strong>Step 2:</strong> Oxidation to sulfuric acid<br>\n                            2H₂SO₃ + O₂ → 2H₂SO₄ (sulfuric acid)\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n                    <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Explain how a catalytic converter reduces vehicle emissions.</p>\n                    <details class=\"mt-2\">\n                        <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Answer</summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            A catalytic converter contains platinum, palladium, and rhodium catalysts that:\n                            <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside mt-1\">\n                                <li><strong>Oxidation reactions:</strong> 2CO + O₂ → 2CO₂ and CₙH₂ₙ₊₂ + O₂ → CO₂ + H₂O</li>\n                                <li><strong>Reduction reactions:</strong> 2NO → N₂ + O₂ and 2NO₂ → N₂ + 2O₂</li>\n                            </ul>\n                            These convert harmful gases (CO, NOₓ, hydrocarbons) into less harmful products (CO₂, N₂, H₂O).\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n                    <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Why is ground-level ozone considered a pollutant while stratospheric ozone is beneficial?</p>\n                    <details class=\"mt-2\">\n                        <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Answer</summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            <strong>Stratospheric ozone (ozone layer):</strong> Located 15-35 km up, it absorbs harmful UV radiation from the sun, protecting living organisms from DNA damage.<br><br>\n                            <strong>Ground-level ozone:</strong> A component of photochemical smog that causes respiratory problems, eye irritation, and damages crops. It's harmful because we breathe it directly.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n                    <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Describe how a flue gas desulfurization (FGD) system works.</p>\n                    <details class=\"mt-2\">\n                        <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Answer</summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            FGD systems (scrubbers) remove SO₂ from power plant emissions:\n                            <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>Flue gas containing SO₂ passes through a scrubber</li>\n                                <li>Spray of limestone slurry (CaCO₃) or lime (CaO) reacts with SO₂</li>\n                                <li>CaCO₃ + SO₂ → CaSO₃ + CO₂</li>\n                                <li>CaSO₃ is oxidized to CaSO₄ (gypsum)</li>\n                                <li>Gypsum can be sold for construction materials</li>\n                            </ol>\n                            This removes 90-97% of SO₂ from emissions.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Key Takeaways -->\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 animate-fade-in-up\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -star mr-2\" data-mi=\"star\">star</span>Key Takeaways</h3>\n            <ul class=\"text-emerald-700 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                <li>• Primary pollutants: CO, SO₂, NOₓ, particulates; Secondary: O₃, acid rain, smog</li>\n                <li>• Acid rain: SO₂ + H₂O → H₂SO₄; NOₓ + H₂O → HNO₃ (pH &lt; 5.6)</li>\n                <li>• Greenhouse gases: CO₂, CH₄, N₂O, CFCs trap heat and cause global warming</li>\n                <li>• Photochemical smog: NOₓ + VOCs + sunlight → O₃ + PANs</li>\n                <li>• Controls: Catalytic converters, scrubbers, electrostatic precipitators, alternative energy</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mt-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/chemistry/environmental-green/\" class=\"px-4 py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900\">\n                <span class=\"mi -chevron-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"chevron_left\">chevron_left</span>Previous\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/chemistry/environmental-green/water-pollution/\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-600\">\n                Next: Water Pollution<span class=\"mi -chevron-right ml-2\" data-mi=\"chevron_right\">chevron_right</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    \n\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-gray-50 min-h-screen","bodyStyle":"","css":["@keyframes fade-in-up {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n        .animate-fade-in-up { animation: fade-in-up 0.5s ease-out forwards; }\n        .section-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n        }\n        .video-container {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            padding-bottom: 56.25%;\n            height: 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            background: #f9fafb;\n        }\n        .video-container iframe {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0; left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border: none;\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}